cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or evaluate KineGrant Protocol, cite this software and identify the exact release or commit tested."
title: "KineGrant Protocol"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Zoah"
version: 2.37.0
date-released: 2026-08-15
url: "https://kinegrant.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zoahdev/kinegrant-protocol"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  KineGrant is an experimental authorization and accountability layer for
  physical AI. KGP-001 defines action requests, policy evaluation,
  short-lived single-use capabilities, local action-gate verification, and
  signed receipts. The reference implementation is not a functional-safety
  system and is not production-ready.
keywords:
  - physical AI
  - machine authorization
  - robotics security
  - capability-based security
  - replay protection
  - signed receipts
